# Nasty Little Rabbit, a 1/2: "Ferocious - At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control a creature with power 4 or
# greater, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." An intervening "if" (CR 603.4): checked as combat begins and again on resolution.
# Turn 1: Bot1 controls only a Hill Giant (power 3, just short) and the Rabbit itself: no counter. Turn 3: an Alpine Grizzly (power
# 4 exactly) was cast, so one counter (a 2/3). Turn 5: Bot2 answers the trigger with a Lightning Bolt on the Alpine Grizzly, so
# the condition fails as the ability tries to resolve and there is no second counter.

